OL,3,T///,/,-.,./,,-,-,-.-.,-.,/-.-.,.,.,,///
OL,4,CUS Army says controlled blast of       
OL,5,Cexplosives in Iowa was 'huge success'  
OL,6,FIt also warned locals of "potential    
OL,7,Fexposure to toxic lead dust" - an      
OL,8,Foptional evacuation zone and a shelter 
OL,9,Fin place advisory were among the       
OL,10,Fmeasures in place.                     
OL,12,FSome residents living nearby say they  
OL,13,Fdid not "hear a thing", while others   
OL,14,Fin the area report it sounding "like   
OL,15,Fsomething huge just exploded".         
OL,17,FOver in neighbouring Missouri, the     
OL,18,Fgovernor says initial analysis         
OL,19,Fsuggests "mitigation measures appear   
OL,20,Fto have been successful".              
OL,22,                                   G2/2 
